@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 120
hide empty members
top to bottom direction
title SkyCrop - Diagnoses Generation - Diseño por capas
package "Interfaces / Presentation" {
class DiagnosisController <<controller>> {
-service: IDiagnosisApplicationService
+generate(request: GenerateDiagnosisRequest): DiagnosisResource
+getById(id: Long): DiagnosisResource
}
class GenerateDiagnosisRequest <<request>> {
-plotId: Long
-imageIds: List<Long>
}
class DiagnosisResource <<resource>> {
-id: Long
}
class DiagnosisResourceAssembler <<assembler>> {
+toResource(entity: Diagnosis): DiagnosisResource
}
}
package "Application" {
class GenerateDiagnosisCommand <<command>> {
-plotId: Long
-imageIds: List<Long>
}
interface IDiagnosisApplicationService {
+generate(command: GenerateDiagnosisCommand): DiagnosisResource
+getById(id: Long): DiagnosisResource
}
class DiagnosisApplicationService <<application service>> {
-repository: IDiagnosisRepository
+generate(command: GenerateDiagnosisCommand): DiagnosisResource
+getById(id: Long): DiagnosisResource
}
}
package "Domain" {
class Diagnosis <<aggregate root>> {
-id: Long
-generatedAt: Timestamp
-status: DiagnosisStatus
+generate(): void
}
interface IDiagnosisRepository <<repository contract>> {
+findById(id: Long): Diagnosis [0..1]
+save(entity: Diagnosis): void
}
}
package "Infrastructure" {
class DiagnosisRepository <<repository>> {
-dbContext: SkyCropDbContext
+findById(id: Long): Diagnosis [0..1]
+save(entity: Diagnosis): void
}
class SkyCropDbContext <<EF Core>> {
+saveChanges(): int
}
}
DiagnosisController --> IDiagnosisApplicationService : delega
DiagnosisController ..> GenerateDiagnosisRequest : recibe
DiagnosisController ..> GenerateDiagnosisCommand : construye
DiagnosisController ..> DiagnosisResource : responde
DiagnosisApplicationService ..|> IDiagnosisApplicationService
IDiagnosisApplicationService ..> GenerateDiagnosisCommand : recibe
DiagnosisApplicationService --> IDiagnosisRepository : consulta y persiste
DiagnosisApplicationService ..> Diagnosis : ejecuta operaciones
DiagnosisApplicationService ..> DiagnosisResourceAssembler : transforma
DiagnosisResourceAssembler ..> Diagnosis : lee
DiagnosisResourceAssembler ..> DiagnosisResource : produce
DiagnosisRepository ..|> IDiagnosisRepository
IDiagnosisRepository ..> Diagnosis : contrato de persistencia
DiagnosisRepository --> SkyCropDbContext : acceso a datos
package "Application" {
interface IImageAnalysis <<integration contract>> {
+analyze(imageIds: List<Long>): String
}
}
package "Infrastructure" {
class ImageAnalysisAdapter <<adapter>> {
+analyze(imageIds: List<Long>): String
}
}
DiagnosisApplicationService --> IImageAnalysis : solicita operación
ImageAnalysisAdapter ..|> IImageAnalysis
note bottom of ImageAnalysisAdapter
Analiza las imágenes referenciadas y devuelve resultados.
end note
DiagnosisController -[hidden]down-> DiagnosisApplicationService
DiagnosisApplicationService -[hidden]down-> Diagnosis
Diagnosis -[hidden]down-> DiagnosisRepository
legend bottom
Arquitectura de clases propuesta para el backend RESTful API.
La vista muestra un caso de uso del contexto y su consulta por identidad.
Los atributos del agregado se detallan en las vistas del dominio.
Las dependencias de infraestructura implementan contratos internos.
endlegend
@enduml
